          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, jUSTICE GINSBURG: Why?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7a6c040331858acefa9ecf7bf5f3fd3deb48579f42c5e1112bcd29a1f258a05b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7a6c04033185-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 7,
              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Souter, jUSTICE SOUTER: How do we \u2026 what significance do we give to this obligation to keep the government informed?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7a6c040331858acefa9ecf7bf5f3fd3deb48579f42c5e1112bcd29a1f258a05b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7a6c04033185-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "JUSTICE SCALIA: If you say it would come out differently, then isn\u2019t it silly to make the State go on and say that?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7a6c040331858acefa9ecf7bf5f3fd3deb48579f42c5e1112bcd29a1f258a05b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7a6c04033185-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Breyer, jUSTICE BREYER: Is it a tiny minority \u2026"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7a6c040331858acefa9ecf7bf5f3fd3deb48579f42c5e1112bcd29a1f258a05b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7a6c04033185-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 41,
              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, jUSTICE STEVENS: \u2026 you might not have an obligation, it seemed to me you would have a motivation to do more because you want to collect your taxes."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7a6c040331858acefa9ecf7bf5f3fd3deb48579f42c5e1112bcd29a1f258a05b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7a6c04033185-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 57,
              "start": 57
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Souter, jUSTICE SOUTER: Why isn\u2019t the simple answer to put notice on the house door?"
      }
